== Documented Changes ==
=== General Fixes ===
* Fixed {{s|Ashpit}} crashing the game when lighting is disabled
* Fixed some challenges showing up as locked despite being previously available
* Fixed several controller rebinding issues with {{C|Jacob and Esau}} and other controllable player entities (i.e. {{I|Strawman}}, {{T|Found Soul}})
* Fixed {{s|The Void}} portal having no animation in {{s|Mausoleum}} 2 under certain circumstances
* Fixed {{I|Tech X}} rings bouncing endlessly with {{I|Rubber Cement}}
* Fixed bouncy and orbiting tears never disappearing in side-scrolling sections
* Fixed {{I|Mucormycosis}} tears becoming much larger than intended when splitting
* Fixed [[Ultra Greed]]'s health bar not disappearing as intended during his death animation
* Fixed [[Ultra Greedier]] not having boss armor (that was a bug sorry!)
* Fixed items generated by {{I|TMTRAINER}} not being saved correctly by {{I|Glowing Hourglass}} or upon saving and resuming a run
* Fixed {{I|Spirit Sword}} and {{I|Urn of Souls}} not triggering effects that occur when tears are fired (i.e. {{I|Isaac's Tears}}, {{I|Mom's Wig}}, {{I|Immaculate Heart}})
* Fixed pause screen sometimes not playing its appear animation
* Fixed {{P|Wild Card}} being tied to the wrong achievement
* Fixed the {{A|Backasswards}} challenge giving the player two of each key piece
* Fixed items not being removed correctly on each floor in the Backasswards challenge
* Fixed {{I|1up!}} causing {{C|Black Judas}} to die instantly upon reviving
* Fixed an infinite loop caused by using the {{P|Joker}} in an Angel shop
* Fixed "[[Tainted Lazarus|Lazarus]]" sometimes turning into {{C|Isaac}} upon saving and resuming a run
* Fixed some rooms not being saved correctly in [[Greed Mode]], causing crashes upon resuming a run (this was most notable with crawlspaces)
* Fixed "[[Tainted Forgotten|The Forgotten]]" not showing any items on the game over screen
* Fixed [[Golden Trinket|golden trinkets]] not being saved correctly upon resuming a run
* Fixed {{I|Delirious}} breaking the backdrop in a certain final boss fight
* Fixed [[Delirium|Delirium's]] death static effect sometimes not rendering correctly
* Fixed {{I|Red Key}} becoming unusable when absorbed by {{I|Void}}
* Fixed co-op player respawns in [[Greed Mode]]
* Fixed a crash that could occur from throwing rocks
* Fixed a crash that occurred when using {{I|Glowing Hourglass}} under certain circumstances in co-op mode
* Fixed {{C|Bethany}} reviving at one half soul heart instead of one half red heart with {{I|Guppy's Collar}}
* Fixed {{I|Thunder Thighs}} / {{I|Leo}} killing the player if they touched a spike rock at one half soul heart

=== Changes ===
* Raised the cooldown of {{I|Blank Card}} from 2 to 4 when used with {{P|Holy Card}} (Note: Despite the patch notes saying the cooldown was changed, it remains unchanged in game.)
* Souls dropped by enemies with the {{I|Urn of Souls}} are now automatically collected when exiting the room
* Added a few more unique {{I|Dirty Mind}} dips for certain special poops
* The following items now count towards the [[Planetarium]] unlock: {{I|Deck of Cards}}, {{I|Tarot Cloth}}, {{I|Zodiac}}, {{I|Card Reading}}, {{I|Echo Chamber}}
* The following items can no longer by found by "[[Tainted Lost|The Lost]]": {{I|Best Bud}}, {{I|Hallowed Ground}} (Note: Despite the patch notes claiming that best bud can no longer be found by "The Lost", it is still possible to find in game.)
* [[Hearts#Rotten Heart|Rotten hearts]] will now be replaced by half red hearts in room layouts that contain them if they haven't been unlocked yet
* {{I|Red Key}} can no longer be obtained in [[Greed Mode]]
* {{I|Brimstone}}/{{I|Technology}}+{{I|Ipecac}}+{{I|The Ludovico Technique}} now only starts exploding 1 second after entering a room and no longer explodes on contact with room boundaries (this could cause unavoidable damage)
* Added unique appearances for {{I|Book of Virtues}} wisps created from {{I|Delirious}} and {{I|Mom's Bracelet}}

== Undocumented Changes ==
* The spider from {{i|The Intruder}} will no longer leave your body if it would result in an empty player sprite. (e.g. when you have {{i|Transcendence}}).
* Items that proc upon damage taken no longer proc on white fires.
* Fixed the {{i|Spirit Sword}} and {{i|Epiphora}} synergy resulting in you unable to perform a spin slash.
* Fixed XL floors causing manhole covers to not work in the [[Isaac's Awakening]] challenge.
* Fixed Bethany starting with an extra book touch in the [[Bloody Mary]] challenge.
* Fixed the bug where {{i|Alabaster Box}} and {{i|Eden's Soul}} would start with full charges when crafted with the {{i|Bag of Crafting}}.
* Fixed the bug where {{i|Teleport 2.0}} could crash the game if you used it on a fully explored [[Mines]] 2 or [[Ashpit]] 2.
* {{i|Flip}}, {{i|Bag of Crafting}}, {{i|Sumptorium}}, {{i|Recall}}, and {{i|Hold}} have been removed from the [[Collection Page (Repentance)|collection page]] and the {{i|Death Certificate}}.
* Changed Ending 14 with a new art style that is similar to the new endings that were added in Repentance.

